    description: "Bakeoff DEEP self-analysis (session deep-20260306-232500) found that forward slices from __main__ cannot reach lang analyzer code because the registry-based dynamic dispatch (register_analyzer → .analyze()) is not followed. Zero ast_call_direct edges cross package boundaries despite 1,529 import edges doing so. Fix: when building the call graph, recognize the registry pattern and add synthetic call edges from run_all_analyzers/run_behavior_map to each registered analyzer's .analyze() method."  # 43bb
